<title>UK: RANK TO BUY BACK UP TO 10 PCT OF SHARES.</title>
<headline>RANK TO BUY BACK UP TO 10 PCT OF SHARES.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rank Group Plc on Friday confirmed that it intends to start a share buy back of up to 83.6 million shares, around 10 percent of the company's issued ordinary share capital.</p>
<p>Rank's chief executive Andrew Teare told Reuters on Thursday that the leisure company would buy back more of its own shares in the next few days than first envisaged.</p>
<p>The company received shareholder approval for the share buy back at its annual meeting in April, a mandate which lasts for this financial year.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
